WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.540
One last job. Eco Town needs a new school.

2
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:07.161
<v Posy>Posy: Put the school right in the middle, Florence!

3
00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:08.826
<v Florence>Florence: The middle. I will measure!

4
00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:13.114
<v Florence>Florence: Here! The exact middle of the island. I am 81% sure!

5
00:00:14.984 --> 00:00:17.649
<v Dev>Dev: That is a long way from my house.

6
00:00:18.319 --> 00:00:19.815
The middle of what?

7
00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:21.809
And who should Florence ask?
